banglaflow (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bugfix release: 1.0.1
  * Direct digit typing: top row numbers and keypad numbers unconditionally type digits without hijacking candidate selection.
  * Fix preedit erasing bug in Chrome/GTK on mouse click and Space commit.
  * Update engine symbol to 'bn' for clean GNOME Shell top panel indicator.
  * Add official GNU General Public License v3.0 text.
  * Fix bisarga colon handling.

 -- Sakib <sakib@example.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:20:00 +0600

banglaflow (1.0.0-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Official 1.0.0 Stable Release.
  * Support Bisarga via Colon (:) during composition (e.g. du:kho -> দুঃখ).
  * Support explicit Hasanta via double comma (,,) during composition (e.g. k,, -> ক্‌).
  * Add double consonant to Z-fola phonetic suggestions (e.g. somossa -> সমস্যা, dhonnobad -> ধন্যবাদ).
  * Unified number behavior: Bengali digits (০-৯) when enabled, English digits (0-9) when disabled across both top row and NumPad.
  * Full Avro Phonetic compatibility, clean system function keys (F1-F12), and zero switch delay.

 -- Sakib <sakib@example.com>  Thu, 30 Oct 2026 00:10:00 +0600

banglaflow (0.1.0-6) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix NumPad keys outputting garbled Halfwidth forms; support digits 0-9 and operators +, -, *, /, .
  * Allow Backtick (`) to output directly when not composing.
  * Preserve native system functionality for Function keys (F1-F12), Esc, Delete, PrintScreen, ScrollLock.
  * Guard all special X11 keysyms (0xFF00-0xFFFF) from being converted to chr() or hijacking input.

 -- Sakib <sakib@example.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:38:00 +0600

banglaflow (0.1.0-5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix Bengali Dari (.) wiping out composing word on commit by making commit atomic.
  * Fix 1-2 second delay on input method switch by pre-warming dictionary singleton and using binary cache.

 -- Sakib <sakib@example.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:05:00 +0600

banglaflow (0.1.0-4) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Strictly place primary phonetic conversion at candidate position 0 (edit panel).
  * Never forcibly replace user keystrokes in preedit (e.g. s gives স, S gives শ, Sh gives ষ).
  * Follow primary conversion with intelligently ranked suggestions and completions.

 -- Sakib <sakib@example.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:47:00 +0600

banglaflow (0.1.0-3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add comprehensive 177,000+ Bengali dictionary wordlist.
  * Intelligent suggestion ranking: automatic chandrabindu matching (e.g. chad -> চাঁদ).
  * Fast bisect prefix search for auto-completing longer words.
  * Phonetic ambiguity expansion (o/O, v/bh, ch/chh, sh/s/S).

